            "badge": "✓ Verified Buyer"
          }
        },
        "rg_review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "group": "ENERGY",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/rg-review-2.jpg",
            "title": "Excellent coffee replacement",
            "text": "I'm extremely happy with this one. The blend of herbs and mushrooms is excellent for giving you a sharp mind without the caffeine jitters. …In the morning, I mix some of this with cold water and chocolate syrup for added flavor. Shake it up, drink it on the way to work, and I'm nice and alert by the time I get there. Definitely recommend.",
            "name": "P. Chu",
            "badge": "Amazon Vine Review"
          }
        },
        "rg_review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "group": "FOCUS",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/rg-review-3.jpg",
            "title": "Great Coffee with Added Creatine",
            "text": "I already take creatine every day for focus and workouts, so having it in my coffee too is very convenient, like two products in one. I also like that this coffee is really made in the USA. Before, I bought products that were actually made somewhere else. It's convenient and I trust it.",
            "name": "Stanislav Kolomiiets",
            "badge": "✓ Verified Buyer"
          }
        },
        "rg_review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "group": "FOCUS",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/rg-review-4.jpg",
            "title": "Pretty good coffee",
            "text": "Raw Coffee+ delivers a smooth, mellow coffee experience with significantly less caffeine than regular coffee, making it ideal for those who want focus without jitters. The addition of Lion's Mane and other nootropics provides a noticeable boost in mental clarity and sustained energy, rather than a quick spike and crash. …This coffee is a great choice for productivity and focus.",
            "name": "Ms White",
            "badge": "Amazon Vine Review"
          }
        },
        "rg_review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "group": "TASTE",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/rg-review-5.jpg",
            "title": "Nice energy without the jitters",
            "text": "I've been taking creatine regularly, so I wanted to try this since it already has creatine in it. I actually really like it. The taste is good, and I don't notice any weird aftertaste. What I like most is the energy. It feels smooth and gives me a nice little boost without making me jittery like stronger coffee sometimes does. I usually have it in the morning and it's been an easy addition to my routine.",
            "name": "Yulia Wilson",
            "badge": "✓ Verified Buyer"
          }
        },
        "rg_review_6": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "group": "TASTE",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/rg-review-6.jpg",
            "title": "Great flavor, low-caffeine coffee with lion's mane & creatine",
            "text": "The taste is probably my favorite part. It has a really nice, rich coffee flavor and doesn't have that overly earthy mushroom taste that some mushroom coffees can have. I usually mix mine with almond milk and a little natural sweetener, and it turns into almost a dessert-like coffee drink.",
